{
    "title": "GeoGuessr",
    "description": "Welcome to the world of GeoGuessr! Embark on an epic journey that takes you from the most desolate roads in Australia to the busy, bustling streets of New York City. Search for signs, language, flags, nature, internet top domains, or just about any clue that helps you to find where you are.\r\n\r\nEMBARK ON YOUR OWN JOURNEY\r\nHow far can you go in GeoCrusher? Want to explore your favorite map? Start a Country Streak and see how long it can get? Take on the explorer hat and challenge yourself in our different single player modes.\r\n\r\nCOMPETE AGAINST OTHERS\r\nPut your skill to the test against players all around the world. Duel against other players on your skill level or compete in our Battle Royale modes and see who will make it to the end. How far can you climb on the leaderboard?\r\n\r\nPLAY WITH YOUR FRIENDS\r\nHost your own party and invite your friends to join. Choose to play against each other in different game modes. Who will come out on top?\r\n\r\nCROSS-PLATFORM\r\nPlay both with and against players on mobile and on the website.\r\n\r\nBECOME ANYTHING YOU CAN DESIRE\r\nEmbrace boundless creativity and express your individuality like never before! Personalize your virtual alter ego with a vast assortment of hats, shirts, faces, gear, and a treasure trove of other options.\r\n\r\nSupport: \r\nAre you experiencing issues? Visit https://www.geoguessr.com/support or email us at support@geoguessr.com for further help.\r\n\r\nTerms of use: \r\nhttps://www.geoguessr.com/terms\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy:\r\nhttps://www.geoguessr.com/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the world of GeoGuessr! Embark on an epic journey that takes you from the most desolate roads in Australia to the busy, bustling streets of New York City. Search for signs, language, flags, nature, internet top domains, or just about any clue that helps you to find where you are.<br><br>EMBARK ON YOUR OWN JOURNEY<br>How far can you go in GeoCrusher? Want to explore your favorite map? Start a Country Streak and see how long it can get? Take on the explorer hat and challenge yourself in our different single player modes.<br><br>COMPETE AGAINST OTHERS<br>Put your skill to the test against players all around the world. Duel against other players on your skill level or compete in our Battle Royale modes and see who will make it to the end. How far can you climb on the leaderboard?<br><br>PLAY WITH YOUR FRIENDS<br>Host your own party and invite your friends to join. Choose to play against each other in different game modes. Who will come out on top?<br><br>CROSS-PLATFORM<br>Play both with and against players on mobile and on the website.<br><br>BECOME ANYTHING YOU CAN DESIRE<br>Embrace boundless creativity and express your individuality like never before! Personalize your virtual alter ego with a vast assortment of hats, shirts, faces, gear, and a treasure trove of other options.<br><br>Support: <br>Are you experiencing issues? Visit https://www.geoguessr.com/support or email us at support@geoguessr.com for further help.<br><br>Terms of use: <br>https://www.geoguessr.com/terms<br><br>Privacy policy:<br>https://www.geoguessr.com/privacy",
